# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Demo / sandbox artifacts (generated; not source)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pinned checkouts and service account keys live here and must stay out.
# `demo/fixtures` is the exception and is tracked explicitly (`git add -f`):
# those notices are source, and Change Intelligence can only refuse without
# them. An exception cannot be written here, because git will not re-include a
# path from inside an excluded directory.
/demo/
/artifacts/
/submission/
/sandbox-workspaces/
/tmp-patchapi/
